__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- Client data: belt and braces -----------------------------------------------------------
# scripts/scrub_check.py already BLOCKS a commit containing any of these. This list is the second
# layer, so they never reach the index at all. A .gitignore is not a substitute for the gate (it
# is bypassed with `git add -f` and does nothing about files already tracked).
#
# The skill reads signed P&S agreements, deeds, probate papers and corporate records, and writes
# finished POAs, all naming real people and addresses. Never point a run at a checkout.
*.pdf
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.heic
*.tif
*.tiff
*.doc
*.docx
*.rtf
*.odt
*.msg
*.eml
# ...except the two inspected templates (allowlisted by exact path AND hash in scrub_check.py)
!skills/seller-poa/assets/POA. Seller. Form 2.docx
!skills/seller-poa/assets/POA. Seller. Form 4.docx
poa_values*.json
ps_accepted*.txt
ps_redline*.txt

# Never, under any circumstances, the name map or the tools that carry real names. They live
# OUTSIDE this repository by design.
*namemap*
*apply_scrub*
*verify_scrub*
*scrub_inventory*
*rebuild_templates*
*PRIVATE*

# Credentials and local environments
.env
*.pem
*.key
.venv/
venv/
